---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms governing your use of our loan matching service.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <p>Please read these Terms of Use ("Terms") carefully before using this website. By accessing or using our service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use this site.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">1. About Our Service</h2>
      <p>SecureLoan is a <strong>free matching service</strong>, not a lender. We connect consumers with a network of third-party lenders and financial institutions. We do not make credit decisions, originate loans, or guarantee that any lender will make you an offer. Loan terms, rates, and availability vary by lender and state.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>To use our service, you must:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Be at least 18 years of age (19 in Alabama and Nebraska; 21 in Mississippi).</li>
        <li>Be a legal resident of the United States.</li>
        <li>Have a valid bank account in your name.</li>
        <li>Provide accurate, truthful, and complete information in all forms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">3. No Guarantee of Loan Approval</h2>
      <p>Submitting a request through our service does <strong>not</strong> guarantee loan approval or a specific APR, loan amount, or repayment term. All credit decisions are made solely by participating lenders based on their individual criteria.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>We receive compensation from lenders and partners when a consumer is matched and/or completes a loan application. This compensation may influence which lenders appear on our platform but does not affect the accuracy of our information or your eligibility with any lender.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">5. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>Information on this site is provided for general informational purposes only. Rates, terms, and offers displayed are estimates and may not reflect current lender offerings. Always review the lender's official terms before accepting any offer.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">6. Prohibited Uses</h2>
      <p>You agree not to use this website to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Submit false, fraudulent, or misleading information.</li>
        <li>Violate any applicable federal, state, or local law.</li>
        <li>Interfere with the operation or security of the site.</li>
        <li>Attempt to access data not intended for you.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, SecureLoan and its officers, directors, employees, and agents shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, this service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of those sites. Your interactions with third-party lenders are governed solely by their own terms and policies.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">9. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of New York, without regard to conflict of law provisions. Any disputes shall be resolved exclusively in the courts located in New York County, New York.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">10. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the site following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">11. Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: legal@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
